  <div class="wrapper">
    <h2 class="section-title">Key Achievements</h2>

    <div class="achievement">
      <h3><a href={`${base}blog/cloud-cost-optimization-three-initiatives/`}>$500K+ Cloud Savings</a></h3>
      <p>
        Delivered cumulative cost optimizations across Adobe, Tokopedia, and
        Paytm through automation, rightsizing, and infra audits.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="achievement">
      <h3>Publications</h3>
      <p>
        Authored technical blogs on <a href="https://www.tothenew.com/blog/how-to-setup-kubernetes-master-ha-on-centos/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Kubernetes</a>, <a href="https://www.tothenew.com/blog/django-application-deployment/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Django</a>, and <a href="https://www.tothenew.com/blog/integration-of-aws-codedeploy-with-jenkins/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">AWS CodeDeploy</a>, providing insights on infrastructure automation and high availability setups.
