        Contributed a <a href="https://github.com/systemd/systemd/pull/43500" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">merged fix to systemd</a> -- Linux's core init/service-management system -- adding missing zsh shell-completion support for <code>systemctl show</code>, reviewed and merged by a project maintainer.
      </p>
